  "macroOverview": "Iranian Revolutionary Guard fired on two commercial vessels near the Strait of Hormuz on July 7, spiking crude oil and triggering a sharp cross-asset rotation: US30 hit year high 53,289 (defensive/energy composition) while NAS100 sold to 28,974 day low and GER40 reversed from year high 25,900 to close -1.37%. GBPCAD hit year high 1.9040 then reversed on CAD strength from oil. Gold is holding above critical 4,078 support at the 4,100-4,135 entry zone. FOMC minutes from June 16-17 meeting release tonight at 19:00 GMT. US CPI June on Friday July 10 is the dominant catalyst of the week; consensus near 3.1% YoY.",
